  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Journey atlas",
    "overview": "Journey atlas connects a repair process through clear milestones, a visible approval pause, and a calm route ground. Broad destination lettering and silver-car illustrations give the system its character; live text carries the information.\n\nThis documents the approved marketing surface. Existing service-application routes retain their incumbent green system. The new palette is not authorization to restyle those routes.",
